WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.980
<b>Ten Years Ago</b>

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:04.980
<i>Ten years ago,</i>

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:09.480
<i>just hours before Oubu 
landed in the ocean...</i>

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.500
<i>A national state of emergency 
has been declared.</i>

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.990
<i>Citizens, please give heed to all 
announcements from the government,</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.520
<i>and obey the evacuation instructions 
of your local police.</i>

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<b>Mejiro Station</b>

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.390
<b>Currently,
 No Casualties</b>

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.390
<b>Massive object from outer space
 to crash into capital.</b>

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>The massive object was seen falling 
from space in eight locations.</i>

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.240
<i>Ohta Ward, Toshima Ward,</i>

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.330
<b>Bunkyo Ward, Tokyo</b>

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.330
<b>State of Emergency Declared</b>

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.330
<i>Chiyoda Ward, Shinjuku Ward, and Sumida Ward,</i>

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.480
<i>among other wards where multiple 
flying objects were sighted.</i>

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:06.480
<i>Its immense power</i>

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.760
<i>gave rise to fear.</i>

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.970
<i>Citizens are advised to follow 
evacuation instructions.</i>

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.250
<i>The Buranki that defeated all the others</i>

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:16.180
<i>Traffic is prohibited on all roads from 
Loop 7 inward to the city's center.</i>

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.810
<i>was no hero.</i>

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:23.580
<i>That was the day...</i>

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:26.020
<i>Reoko and Entei's reign of terror began.</i>

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:33.780
